Fendur the Outfitter~
A ranger of slight build tries to sell you supplies.
~
   Fendur has become known within the ranger's guild as the man who can 'get
whatever you need', be it the pelt of a yeti or a simple shark's tooth.  An
expert in wilderness survival, Fendur is rumored to have lived for sixteen
months in the forest of Haon-Dor with only a simple cloth tunic and roll of
tissue paper.  Upon seeing you, he grabs a quill and paper, preparing to write
down what you require.    
~
