Guildmaster Jhaethin~
The ranger guildmaster, dressed in a black cloak, watches you.
~
   The man who now trains all new rangers to the guild goes by the name of
Jhaethin.  Little is really known him aside that he is hands down the best
tracker and bowman this side of the Emerald Sea.  His dark skinned face is
covered by a heavy grey beard.  His sharp eyes watch you with a careful ease.
~
